en made to the following screens. Additional improvements are also planned for some of the remaining screens.Title ScreenDialogue ScreenSettings ScreenCombat – Setup PhaseCombat – Battle PhaseResults ScreenVarious other minor im","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T18:50:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029995","verified_at":"2026-10-21T22:23:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4080650-1846018067931233","game_id":"steam-4080650","kind":"update","title":"Upcoming Update Announcement","summary":"Hello, this is Myosotis, the developer of DeVILSTOPIA.DeVILSTOPIA will be participating in Steam Next Fest: October 2026. We have been preparing a demo update for the event, but adding and improving some features has taken longer than expected. As a result, the planned changes are not yet included in the publicly available demo.The current build is fully playable. However, this update brings changes to many aspects of the game, including the UI and visuals, and we are working to share these impr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T19:40:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067931233","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4080650-1831432155577050","game_id":"steam-4080650","kind":"update","title":"Demo 1.1.0 Update Notice (Scheduled for May 8)","summary":"Hello, this is Myosotis. DeVILSTOPIA Demo version 1.1.0 is scheduled to be updated on May 8, 2026.■ Demo 1.1.0 (Scheduled for May 8)▶ New UpdatesAdded new stagesAdded 5 new enemies and 1 new bossAdded new skillsAdded new events▶ Sprite ImprovementsImproved some NPC spritesImproved some visual effect sprites▶ Other ImprovementsImproved choice presentation during dialogueFixed some untranslated elementsImproved some skill descriptions▶ Bug FixesWe will notify you again if there are any additional ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-04T10:14:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155577050","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4080650-1824644522840414","game_id":"steam-4080650","kind":"update","title":"Demo 1.0.1 Patch Notes","summary":"▶ UI ImprovementsAdded Max HP display during gameplay.Added Current HP display on the Shop page.▶ Other ImprovementsSkill Un-equipping Logic: In the Setting Phase, un-equipping a skill now removes the most recently equipped skill instead of the first one.▶ Bug FixesFixed an issue where certain enemies would stop acting when knocked back by some skills.Fixed an issue where teleporting characters would freeze after being knocked back.Fixed a stuttering movement issue when certain characters move o","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-13T20:20:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1824644522840414","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4080650-1823825466495097","game_id":"steam-4080650","kind":"announcement","title":"Hello, this is Myosotis from the DeVILSTOPIA development team.","summary":"Hello, we are Myosotis, the development team behind DeVILSTOPIA.First of all, we would like to express our sincere gratitude for playing our demo and showing interest in our game. We are dedicated to creating a more polished and complete experience based on your valuable feedback.If you encounter any inconveniences or have suggestions for improvement during your play, please feel free to reach out to us through the following channel